  m_text: '<b><color=#F8C72D>Mossvale farming</color></b>  Till > Plant > Water >
    Grow > Harvest

    <b>Left-click</b> walk / use tool on a plot

    <b>WASD
    / Arrows</b> walk      <b>E / Space</b> use

    <b>1</b> Hoe  <b>2</b> Seeds 
    <b>3</b> Watering Can  <b>4</b> Basket

    <b>Wheel</b> change tool     <b>Tab</b>
    change seed

    Refill the can at the <b>well</b> or <b>pond</b>

    <b>H</b>
    hide help     <b>F1</b> dev tools'
